<BaseLayout title="Booking Policies | Orchha Palace" description="General arrival, cancellation and payment guidance for Orchha Palace bookings." stickyBooking={false}>
  <article class="legal-page"><div class="legal-page__content shell"><p class="eyebrow">Stay guidance</p><h1>Booking policies</h1><p>Last reviewed: 1 September 2026</p><h2>Arrival and departure</h2><p>Published hotel guidance lists check-in from 2:00 PM and check-out by 10:00 AM. Early arrival and late departure are subject to availability and may carry an additional charge.</p><h2>Rates and inclusions</h2><p>Rates, taxes, meal inclusions and offer conditions are displayed in the official booking engine. No price shown elsewhere on this custom website overrides the booking engine.</p><h2>Cancellation and refunds</h2><p>Cancellation, amendment, prepayment and refund conditions vary by rate and stay dates. Review the exact conditions before payment and retain the confirmation email.</p><h2>Children and extra beds</h2><p>Occupancy, child, rollaway-bed and meal charges vary by room and booking. Confirm the final guest count in the official booking journey or with reservations.</p><h2>Identification and payment</h2><p>Guests may be asked for valid identification at check-in. Card and online payment details are handled by the official booking and payment providers, not this custom website.</p><h2>Need help?</h2><p>Contact <a href="mailto:reservations@orchhapalace.com">reservations@orchhapalace.com</a> or call <a href="tel:+919516006201">+91 95160 06201</a> before booking if a policy affects your travel plans.</p></div></article>
</BaseLayout>
